    hero: {
      title: 'About Entité & Co',
      intro:
        'Entité & Co is not just another web agency. It is a hybrid ecosystem born from a strong conviction: the best projects emerge where cutting-edge technology, beautiful design and the physical world meet.',
    },
    philosophy: {
      title: '“One is all, all is one”',
      text: 'Our philosophy, **"One is all, all is one"**, reflects our global approach. We refuse to work in silos. With us, data feeds design, the web drives sales, and textile embodies your brand in the real world.',
    },
