      },
      {
        slug: 'creation-digitale',
        title: 'The Creative Studio (KVN HGS)',
        description:
          'Web design, e-commerce, graphic design and art direction to forge a memorable digital identity.',
      },
      {
        slug: 'impression-textile',
        title: 'The Physical Workshop (SFB)',
        description:
          'Textile printing and merchandising to make your brand tangible and build community loyalty beyond the screen.',
      },
    ],
    founder: {
      alt: 'Kévin Heugas, founder of Entité & Co, on a Parisian rooftop terrace at sunset',
      eyebrow: 'The Founder',
      role: 'Founder, Lead Data Engineer & Digital Creator',
      intro:
        'The Entité & Co ecosystem reflects the unusual, multidisciplinary background of its founder. Combining top-level technical expertise with a keen artistic sensibility, Kévin embodies this alliance between technology and creativity.',
      points: [
        "With solid training in data engineering (**Master's in Data Engineering & Artificial Intelligence at EFREI**) and hands-on experience at the heart of large companies' information systems (notably within **Enedis' IT department**), he brings analytical rigour and command of complex architectures (Big Data, AI, GDPR).",
        'Alongside this technical background, his self-taught creative profile helps him understand each client’s image, design and business challenges, offering truly complete and distinctive project leadership.',
      ],
    },
    references: {
      title: 'They trust us',
      text: 'From local craftspeople to innovative startups and public institutions, our greatest pride is the diversity of our partners. We scale our capabilities to the size of your ambitions.',
      lead: 'Among our clients:',
      more: 'and many more.',
      cta: 'See our work',
    },
    closing: {
      title: 'Let’s talk about your project.',
      text: 'From the very first idea to large-scale deployment.',
      cta: 'Discuss your project with us',
    },
  },
